<title>USA: Zions Bancorp authorizes another buyback.</title>
<headline>Zions Bancorp authorizes another buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zions Bancorp said Friday that it had completed the $25 million stock repurchase program authorized by its board December 20 and that its board had authorized another $25 million for share buybacks.</p>
</text>
